<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>The Stoic Girl Starter Pack — Module 1: The Foundation</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo+Black&family=Archivo:wght@500;600;700;800;900&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,500;0,600;1,400;1,500;1,600&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --coral:#D64C63;
    --coral-deep:#C23A54;
    --coral-mid:#DD5B70;
    --coral-soft:#E796A6;
    --coral-faint:#F0C4CE;
    --cream:#F6F0E7;
    --cream-card:#FBF7F0;
    --cream-deep:#EFE7DA;
    --ink-on-red:#F5ECDD;
    --ink-on-red-soft:#EAD9C6;
    --line:rgba(214,76,99,.30);
    --line-soft:rgba(214,76,99,.18);
    --dot:rgba(214,76,99,.35);
    --font-display:"Archivo Black",sans-serif;
    --font-heavy:"Archivo",sans-serif;
    --font-serif:"Playfair Display",serif;
    --font-body:"Inter",sans-serif;
    --shadow:0 18px 50px -28px rgba(150,40,60,.55);
    --pagew:940px;
  }

  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
  body{
    margin:0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(1200px 600px at 15% -5%, #FBF6EE 0%, transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(1000px 700px at 100% 100%, #F3EADD 0%, transparent 55%),
      var(--cream);
    color:var(--coral);
    font-family:var(--font-body);
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
    line-height:1.5;
    padding-bottom:80px;
  }

  /* ---------- Toolbar ---------- */
  .toolbar{
    position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;
    background:rgba(246,240,231,.86);
    backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .toolbar-inner{
    max-width:var(--pagew);margin:0 auto;
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;
    padding:11px 26px;flex-wrap:wrap;
  }
  .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;margin-right:auto}
  .brand .wordmark{
    font-family:var(--font-heavy);font-weight:900;
    font-size:16px;letter-spacing:.005em;color:var(--coral);
    line-height:1;
  }
  @media(max-width:520px){.brand .wordmark{font-size:14px}}

  .jump{
    font-family:var(--font-body);font-size:12.5px;font-weight:500;
    color:var(--coral);background:var(--cream-card);
    border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;
    padding:7px 12px;cursor:pointer;appearance:none;
  }
  .tbtn{
    font-family:var(--font-body);font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;
    color:var(--coral);background:var(--cream-card);
    border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;
    padding:7px 13px;cursor:pointer;transition:.15s;
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;
  }
  .tbtn:hover{background:var(--coral);color:var(--ink-on-red);border-color:var(--coral)}
  .tbtn.primary{background:var(--coral);color:var(--ink-on-red);border-color:var(--coral)}
  .tbtn.primary:hover{background:var(--coral-deep)}
  .saved{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--coral-soft);min-width:60px;opacity:0;transition:opacity .3s}
  .saved.show{opacity:1}

  /* ---------- Page shell ---------- */
  .wrap{max-width:var(--pagew);margin:0 auto;padding:34px 26px 0}
  .page{
    position:relative;
    background:var(--cream-card);
    border:1px solid var(--line-soft);
    border-radius:8px;
    box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    padding:46px 54px 40px;
    margin:0 0 34px;
    scroll-margin-top:78px;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .page.red{
    background:linear-gradient(160deg,#DB5067 0%, #D2455E 60%, #C63D57 100%);
    color:var(--ink-on-red);border-color:transparent;
  }

  /* running head */
  .runhead{
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
    font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.05em;color:var(--coral-soft);
    margin-bottom:30px;
  }
  .red .runhead{color:var(--ink-on-red-soft)}
  .runhead .tag{font-family:var(--font-serif);font-style:italic;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.02em;opacity:.9}
  .dots{display:flex;gap:5px;align-items:center}
  .dots i{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;border:1.4px solid var(--dot);display:block}
  .red .dots i{border-color:rgba(245,236,221,.6)}
  .dots i.on{background:var(--coral);border-color:var(--coral)}
  .red .dots i.on{background:var(--ink-on-red);border-color:var(--ink-on-red)}
  .seal{width:18px;height:18px;color:var(--coral-soft)}
  .red .seal{color:var(--ink-on-red-soft)}

  /* footers */
  .runfoot{
    display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;
    margin-top:34px;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--coral-soft);
  }
  .red .runfoot{color:var(--ink-on-red-soft)}
  .runfoot .motto{font-style:italic;font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:12px;line-height:1.3;max-width:150px}
  .runfoot .cred b{font-family:var(--font-heavy);font-weight:800;color:var(--coral)}
  .red .runfoot .cred b{color:var(--ink-on-red)}
  .runfoot .pg{font-family:var(--font-heavy);font-weight:800;font-size:16px;color:var(--coral-soft)}
  .red .runfoot .pg{color:var(--ink-on-red-soft)}

  /* ---------- Typography ---------- */
  .eyebrow{font-family:var(--font-serif);font-style:italic;font-weight:500;font-size:26px;color:var(--coral-mid);margin:0 0 2px}
  .display{
    font-family:var(--font-display);
    font-size:clamp(34px,6vw,62px);line-height:.94;
    letter-spacing:-.01em;color:var(--coral);margin:0;
    text-transform:uppercase;
  }
  .display.sm{font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,46px)}
  .red .display{color:var(--ink-on-red)}
  .kicker{
    font-family:var(--font-body);font-weight:600;font-size:19px;
    line-height:1.15;color:var(--coral-deep);margin:0 0 10px;letter-spacing:-.01em;
  }
  p{margin:0 0 11px}
  .body{font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.62;color:var(--coral);text-align:justify;hyphens:auto}
  .body em{font-style:italic;color:var(--coral-deep)}
  .body strong{font-weight:700;color:var(--coral-deep)}
  .lead{font-size:14px}
  .cap{font-size:11px;color:var(--coral-soft);font-style:italic;font-family:var(--font-serif)}

  .cols{column-gap:34px}
  .cols.c2{column-count:2}
  .cols.c3{column-count:3}
  @media(max-width:820px){.cols.c2,.cols.c3{column-count:1}}
  .colblock{break-inside:avoid;margin-bottom:20px}

  hr.rule{border:none;border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin:24px 0}

  /* callout */
  .callout{
    border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;
    padding:16px 16px 15px;background:rgba(214,76,99,.045);
    font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.5;
  }
  .callout .ct{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-weight:700;color:var(--coral-deep);margin-bottom:7px}
  .callout .ct svg{width:15px;height:15px;flex:none}
  .callout p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}

  /* quote */
  blockquote.frankl{
    border-left:3px solid var(--coral);margin:8px 0 12px;padding:4px 0 4px 15px;
    font-family:var(--font-serif);font-style:italic;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--coral-deep);
  }

  /* numbered lessons */
  .lessons{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:26px 40px;margin-top:6px}
  @media(max-width:720px){.lessons{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  .lesson{display:grid;grid-template-columns:38px 1fr;gap:12px;break-inside:avoid}
  .lesson .n{font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:40px;line-height:.8;color:var(--coral-soft);font-weight:500}
  .lesson h4{font-family:var(--font-body);font-weight:700;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--coral-deep);margin:6px 0 5px;line-height:1.15}
  .lesson p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;margin:0;color:var(--coral)}

  /* philosopher cards */
  .phils{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px}
  .phil{display:grid;grid-template-columns:82px 1fr;gap:16px;align-items:start;break-inside:avoid}
  .phil .frame{
    width:82px;height:96px;border:1px solid var(--line-soft);border-radius:10px;
    background:rgba(214,76,99,.05);overflow:hidden;display:block;
  }
  .phil .frame svg{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;padding:6px}
  .phil h4{font-family:var(--font-body);font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:var(--coral-deep);margin:0 0 4px}
  .phil p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;margin:0}

  /* pillars */
  ol.pillars{margin:6px 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none;counter-reset:p}
  ol.pillars li{counter-increment:p;position:relative;padding:0 0 14px 30px;break-inside:avoid}
  ol.pillars li::before{
    content:counter(p)".";position:absolute;left:0;top:0;
    font-family:var(--font-heavy);font-weight:800;color:var(--coral);font-size:14px;
  }
  ol.pillars b{color:var(--coral-deep)}
  ol.pillars span{display:block;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:2px}

  ul.tick{list-style:none;margin:8px 0;padding:0}
  ul.tick li{position:relative;padding:0 0 8px 16px;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.45;font-style:italic}
  ul.tick li::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:8px;width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--coral-soft)}

  .twosys{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;margin:8px 0}
  .twosys .sys{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:12px 14px}
  .twosys .sys b{display:block;color:var(--coral-deep);font-size:13px;margin-bottom:3px}
  .twosys .sys span{font-size:12px}

  /* brain frames */
  .brainframe{width:110px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;padding:8px;background:rgba(214,76,99,.05);margin:0 0 6px}
  .brainframe svg{width:100%;display:block;padding:4px}

  /* CBT triangle mini */
  .triangle-mini{width:210px;margin:6px auto 4px;display:block}
  .triangle-mini text{font-family:var(--font-serif);font-style:italic;fill:var(--coral-deep);font-size:12px}

  /* ---------- Exercise fields ---------- */
  .purpose-bar{
    border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:12px 16px;
    display:flex;gap:26px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:11px;line-height:1.45;margin:0 0 4px;
    max-width:430px;
  }
  .purpose-bar b{color:var(--coral-deep);font-weight:700}
  .exhead{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap}

  .field-label{font-family:var(--font-body);font-weight:700;font-size:13px;color:var(--coral-deep);margin:0 0 3px}
  .field-label .qh{font-weight:500;font-style:italic;color:var(--coral-mid);font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:14px}
  .field-sub{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--coral-mid);margin:0 0 7px}

  .lines{
    width:100%;border:none;outline:none;resize:vertical;
    background:transparent;color:var(--coral-deep);
    font-family:var(--font-body);font-size:13px;line-height:28px;
    background-image:repeating-linear-gradient(transparent,transparent 27px,var(--line) 27px,var(--line) 28px);
    padding:0;min-height:56px;
  }
  .lines::placeholder{color:var(--coral-faint);font-style:italic}

  .boxfield{
    width:100%;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;
    background:var(--cream);padding:11px 13px;outline:none;resize:vertical;
    font-family:var(--font-body);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--coral-deep);
    min-height:96px;
  }
  .boxfield::placeholder{color:var(--coral-faint);font-style:italic}
  .boxfield:focus,.lines:focus{box-shadow:0 0 0 2px rgba(214,76,99,.18)}

  .grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:22px 34px}
  @media(max-width:720px){.grid2{grid-template-columns:1fr}}

  .prompt-block{margin-bottom:6px}
  .prompt-group-title{font-family:var(--font-body);font-weight:700;color:var(--coral-deep);font-size:13.5px;margin:20px 0 10px;letter-spacing:.01em}

  /* tracker worksheet */
  .tracker-triangle{position:relative;max-width:640px;margin:6px auto}
  .tracker-triangle svg{width:100%;display:block;overflow:visible}
  .tt-box{
    border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;background:var(--cream);
    padding:10px 12px;
  }
  .tt-box .field-sub{margin-bottom:6px}
  .tt-box textarea{min-height:70px}
  .tt-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px;margin-top:14px}
  @media(max-width:720px){.tt-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}

  /* distortions table */
  table.dist{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11.5px;margin-top:8px}
  table.dist th{
    text-align:left;font-family:var(--font-body);font-weight:700;font-size:11px;
    letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--coral-deep);
    padding:9px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(214,76,99,.06);
  }
  table.dist td{padding:9px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line-soft);vertical-align:top;line-height:1.4}
  table.dist td.name{font-weight:700;color:var(--coral-deep);width:20%}
  table.dist td.ex{font-style:italic;color:var(--coral-mid);width:32%}
  table.dist tr:nth-child(even) td{background:rgba(214,76,99,.028)}

  /* bingo grid */
  .bingo{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:0;border:1px solid var(--coral);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;margin:10px 0 6px}
  .bingo .cell{
    border:.5px solid var(--line);min-height:92px;padding:12px 10px;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;
    font-weight:600;font-size:12px;color:var(--coral-deep);line-height:1.25;
    cursor:pointer;position:relative;transition:.15s;user-select:none;
  }
  .bingo .cell small{display:block;font-weight:500;font-size:10px;color:var(--coral-soft);margin-top:2px;font-style:italic}
  .bingo .cell:hover{background:rgba(214,76,99,.06)}
  .bingo .cell.circled{background:rgba(214,76,99,.10)}
  .bingo .cell.circled::after{
    content:"";position:absolute;inset:10px 8px;border:2px solid var(--coral);
    border-radius:50%;pointer-events:none;
    box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(194,58,84,.25);
  }
  @media(max-width:640px){.bingo{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}

  .reflect3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:26px;margin-top:16px}
  @media(max-width:820px){.reflect3{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  .reflect3 .ex-title{font-family:var(--font-body);font-weight:700;color:var(--coral-deep);font-size:13px;margin-bottom:8px}
  .reflect3 .mini-label{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--coral-mid);margin:10px 0 3px;font-weight:500}

  .hint-box{
    border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;padding:14px 15px;background:rgba(214,76,99,.045);
    font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.45;max-width:280px;
  }
  .hint-box .ct{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-weight:700;color:var(--coral-deep);margin-bottom:8px}
  .hint-box .ct svg{width:15px;height:15px}
  .hint-box ul{margin:0;padding-left:16px}
  .hint-box li{margin-bottom:5px}

  .center{text-align:center}
  .ready{font-family:var(--font-serif);font-style:italic;font-size:15px;color:var(--coral-mid);margin-top:26px;text-align:right}

  .spacer{height:8px}
  .divider-hero{min-height:520px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}
  .divider-hero .eyebrow{color:var(--ink-on-red);opacity:.9}
  .divider-hero .subtitle{font-family:var(--font-body);font-weight:600;font-size:22px;color:var(--ink-on-red);margin-top:10px}

  /* toast */
  #toast{
    position:fixed;left:50%;bottom:26px;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(20px);
    background:var(--coral-deep);color:var(--ink-on-red);padding:11px 20px;border-radius:999px;
    font-size:13px;font-weight:600;box-shadow:var(--shadow);opacity:0;pointer-events:none;
    transition:.28s;z-index:80;
  }
  #toast.show{opacity:1;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(0)}

  @media print{
    body{background:#fff;padding:0}
    .toolbar,#toast{display:none}
    .wrap{max-width:none;padding:0}
    .page{box-shadow:none;border:none;border-radius:0;page-break-after:always;padding:34px 40px}
    .page.red{-webkit-print-color-adjust:exact;print-color-adjust:exact}
    .lines,.boxfield,.tt-box textarea{background:#fff}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ============ TOOLBAR ============ -->
<div class="toolbar">
  <div class="toolbar-inner">
    <div class="brand">
      <span class="wordmark">The Stoic Girl Starter Pack</span>
    </div>
    <select class="jump" id="jump" aria-label="Jump to section">
      <option value="">Jump to…</option>
      <option value="p-lessons">Key Lessons</option>
      <option value="p-divider">Module 1 · The Foundation</option>
      <option value="p-a1">Intro to Stoicism (1/2)</option>
      <option value="p-a2">Intro to Stoicism (2/2)</option>
      <option value="p-b1">Emotional OS (1/3)</option>
      <option value="p-b2">Emotional OS (2/3)</option>
      <option value="p-b3">Emotional OS (3/3)</option>
      <option value="p-exintro">Module 1 Exercises</option>
      <option value="p-ex1">Ex 1.1 · TFB Tracker</option>
      <option value="p-ex2">Ex 1.2 · Observer Journal</option>
      <option value="p-ex3">Ex 1.3 · Distortions Bingo</option>
    </select>
    <span class="saved" id="savedMsg">saved ✓</span>
    <button class="tbtn" id="btnExport" title="Download your answers as a file">Export</button>
    <button class="tbtn" id="btnPrint" title="Print or save as PDF">Print</button>
    <button class="tbtn" id="btnReset" title="Clear all answers">Reset</button>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="wrap">

<!-- ============ KEY LESSONS ============ -->
<section class="page" id="p-lessons">
  <div class="runhead">
    <span>00–Introduction</span>
    <svg class="seal" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="3"/><circle cx="7" cy="15" r="3"/><circle cx="17" cy="15" r="3"/></svg>
    <div class="dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
  </div>

  <h1 class="display">Key Lessons<br>You'll Learn</h1>

  <div class="grid2" style="margin-top:34px;align-items:start">
    <div>
      <h3 class="kicker">The Promise:</h3>
      <p class="body">By the end of this journey, you'll have a complete toolkit for emotional regulation, decision-making, boundary setting, and daily peace practices. You'll still feel deeply (that's a <em>feature</em>, btw, not a bug!), but you'll respond from wisdom rather than reactivity.</p>

      <h3 class="kicker" style="margin-top:26px">The Real Talk:</h3>
      <p class="body">This isn't a quick fix or a magical transformation. It's a practice, a way of being, and a <em>lifelong journey</em> of becoming more yourself while building inner strength. Some days will be harder than others, and that's perfectly human.</p>

      <div class="callout" style="margin-top:24px">
        <div class="ct">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="3"/><circle cx="7" cy="15" r="3"/><circle cx="17" cy="15" r="3"/></svg>
          Also, if you're new to Stoicism, don't you worry! I've got you.
        </div>
        <p>Module 1 starts with a gentle introduction to Stoicism itself: what it is, where it came from, and why it matters for your daily life. No prior knowledge required!</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="lessons">
      <div class="lesson"><div class="n">1</div><div><h4>The Foundation: Becoming Aware</h4><p>Understand your emotional operating system and learn to observe your thoughts without being hijacked by them. You'll discover that awareness is the first step to freedom.</p></div></div>
      <div class="lesson"><div class="n">5</div><div><h4>Love Without Losing Yourself</h4><p>Navigate relationships with healthy boundaries and authentic connection. Discover the difference between attachment and love, caring and codependency.</p></div></div>
      <div class="lesson"><div class="n">2</div><div><h4>Control Your Controllables</h4><p>Master the art of focusing your energy on what's actually in your power while releasing the mental grip on everything else. Spoiler: most things aren't in your control, and that can be weirdly liberating.</p></div></div>
      <div class="lesson"><div class="n">6</div><div><h4>Daily Inner Peace Practices</h4><p>Build sustainable habits that support your mental clarity and emotional well-being. Small, consistent actions will compound into unfailing inner strength.</p></div></div>
      <div class="lesson"><div class="n">3</div><div><h4>Character Building (Virtue Edition)</h4><p>Develop your inner compass through the four stoic virtues: wisdom, courage, justice, and temperance. Think of them as your personal values with 2000 years of field testing.</p></div></div>
      <div class="lesson"><div class="n">7</div><div><h4>Ancient Solutions for Modern Problems</h4><p>Apply stoic principles to contemporary challenges like social media comparison, decision fatigue, and information overload. Marcus Aurelius would definitely have thoughts about your Instagram feed (just saying…).</p></div></div>
      <div class="lesson"><div class="n">4</div><div><h4>Feel Everything, React Wisely</h4><p>Learn emotional regulation techniques that honor your sensitivity while building your resilience. You don't have to choose between feeling deeply and thinking clearly.</p></div></div>
      <div class="lesson"><div class="n">8</div><div><h4>Becoming Unshakeable</h4><p>Integrate everything into a coherent sense of self that can weather life's storms while staying true to your values. This is where all the little pieces come together.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="ready">Ready? Let's begin (for real this time, promise!)</p>

