          </div>
          <p class="cap">b. The prefrontal cortex.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h3 class="kicker" style="margin-top:6px">What This Foundation Means for You</h3>
      <p class="body">Now you understand that Stoicism isn't about suppressing emotions, it's about responding wisely.</p>
      <p class="body">You know that your brain's protective instincts can sometimes work against you, creating stories and reactions that don't serve your peace.</p>
      <p class="body">You've learned that thoughts are suggestions, not commands, and that between any trigger and your response lies a space where your power lives.</p>
      <p class="body">Understanding your emotional operating system means:</p>
      <ul class="tick">
        <li>You can catch yourself before spiraling into anxiety</li>
        <li>You can respond to conflict from clarity rather than defensiveness</li>
        <li>You can make decisions from your values rather than your fears</li>
        <li>You can care for others without losing yourself in the process</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="body">Shall we put these insights into practice and start building your awareness toolkit? Then let's gooo!</p>
    </div>
  </div>

