    <span class="motto">Your mind is your most intimate space.</span>
    <span class="pg">12</span>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ EXERCISES INTRO ============ -->
<section class="page" id="p-exintro">
  <div class="runhead">
    <span>01–The Foundation</span>
    <span class="tag">/ex/</span>
    <div class="dots"><i class="on"></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid2" style="align-items:center;margin-top:30px">
    <div>
      <h1 class="display">Module 1<br>Exercises</h1>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="body">Now that you understand how your mind works, it's time to start practicing awareness in real life.</p>
      <p class="body">These three exercises will help you develop what we call <em>"metacognition"</em>: the ability to think about your thinking.</p>

      <div class="colblock" style="margin-top:18px">
        <p class="body"><strong>1. Thought-Feeling-Behavior Tracker</strong><br><span style="font-style:italic;color:var(--coral-mid);font-size:12.5px">This tool gives you a structured way to analyze specific moments when your emotions felt overwhelming. Think of it as your mental microscope: zooming in on exactly how thoughts, feelings, and behaviors connect.</span></p>
        <p class="body" style="margin-top:12px"><strong>2. Observer Mode Journal</strong><br><span style="font-style:italic;color:var(--coral-mid);font-size:12.5px">These prompts help you step back from intense emotions and create some gentle distance from your thoughts. This is pure soft stoicism; learning to observe your inner experience with curiosity instead of getting swept away by it.</span></p>
        <p class="body" style="margin-top:12px"><strong>3. Cognitive Distortions Bingo</strong><br><span style="font-style:italic;color:var(--coral-mid);font-size:12.5px">aka your "Inner Drama Queen Decoder", teaches you to recognize your mind's favorite dramatic stories before they take over. Once you can spot these patterns, you can choose whether to believe them or not.</span></p>
      </div>

      <hr class="rule">
      <p class="body" style="font-size:12.5px"><strong>Exercise 1</strong> is your <em>analytical tool</em>: breaking down specific moments with precision. <strong>Exercise 2</strong> is your <em>gentle awareness practice</em>: creating space and compassion. <strong>Exercise 3</strong> is your <em>pattern recognition system</em>: spotting recurring mental habits.</p>
      <p class="body" style="font-size:12.5px">Together, these tools transform you from someone who experiences thoughts and feelings to someone who can also observe and understand them. That shift changes everything!</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="runfoot">
    <span class="motto">Your mind is your most intimate space.</span>
    <span class="pg">13</span>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ EX 1.1 TRACKER ============ -->
<section class="page" id="p-ex1">
  <div class="runhead">
    <span>01–The Foundation</span>
    <span class="tag">/ex 1.1/</span>
    <div class="dots"><i class="on"></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
