  <div class="exhead">
    <div style="flex:1;min-width:280px">
      <h1 class="display sm">Thought-<wbr>Feeling-<wbr>Behavior<br>Tracker</h1>
      <p class="body" style="max-width:460px;margin-top:12px">Think of a recent moment when you felt a strong emotion, perhaps overwhelmed, anxious, or upset. We're going to break it down step by step to see how your mind works. Try to stay curious here rather than judgmental!</p>
    </div>
    <div class="purpose-bar">
      <div><b>Purpose:</b> Learn to identify the connection between your thoughts, emotions, and actions by analyzing a specific situation step-by-step.</div>
      <div><b>Time estimate:</b> 10–15 minutes</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top:26px">
    <p class="field-label">1) THE SITUATION <span class="qh">(What actually happened)</span></p>
    <p class="field-sub">Describe what happened as if you were a neutral observer. What would a security camera have recorded?</p>
    <textarea class="lines" data-field="tfb_situation" placeholder="Just the facts — no interpretation yet…"></textarea>
  </div>

  <!-- Thought box (top of triangle) -->
  <div style="max-width:420px;margin:26px auto 0">
    <div class="tt-box">
      <p class="field-label" style="margin-bottom:2px">2) THE THOUGHT <span class="qh">(What went through your mind)</span></p>
      <p class="field-sub">What was your first thought? What story did your brain create about this situation?</p>
      <textarea class="boxfield" data-field="tfb_thought" placeholder="Type the exact thought…"></textarea>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Triangle row: Behavior | triangle | Feeling -->
  <div class="tt-grid" style="grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr;align-items:center">
    <div class="tt-box">
      <p class="field-label" style="margin-bottom:2px">4) THE BEHAVIOR <span class="qh">(What you did or wanted to do)</span></p>
      <p class="field-sub">How did you react? What did you do, say, or want to do in response?</p>
      <textarea class="boxfield" data-field="tfb_behavior" placeholder="The action or urge…"></textarea>
    </div>

    <svg width="180" height="150" viewBox="0 0 180 150" style="overflow:visible;margin:0 auto">
      <g stroke="#D64C63" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none">
        <path d="M90 22 L30 128"/>
        <path d="M90 22 L150 128"/>
        <path d="M30 128 L150 128"/>
      </g>
      <circle cx="90" cy="22" r="7" fill="#D64C63"/>
      <circle cx="30" cy="128" r="7" fill="#D64C63"/>
      <circle cx="150" cy="128" r="7" fill="#D64C63"/>
    </svg>

    <div class="tt-box">
      <p class="field-label" style="margin-bottom:2px">3) THE FEELING <span class="qh">(What emotion showed up)</span></p>
      <p class="field-sub">What emotion(s) did you experience? Where did you feel it in your body?</p>
      <textarea class="boxfield" data-field="tfb_feeling" placeholder="Name the emotion + the body sensation…"></textarea>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top:30px">
    <p class="field-label" style="font-size:13.5px;margin-bottom:14px">5) REFLECTION QUESTIONS</p>
    <div class="grid2">
      <div>
        <p class="field-sub" style="color:var(--coral-mid);font-weight:500">Looking at this triangle, what do you notice?</p>
        <textarea class="lines" data-field="tfb_r1" style="min-height:56px"></textarea>
        <p class="field-sub" style="color:var(--coral-mid);font-weight:500;margin-top:14px">What would a more balanced thought sound like?</p>
        <textarea class="lines" data-field="tfb_r2" style="min-height:56px"></textarea>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="field-sub" style="color:var(--coral-mid);font-weight:500">If you could change your initial thought, how might your feeling and behavior have been different?</p>
        <textarea class="lines" data-field="tfb_r3" style="min-height:56px"></textarea>
        <p class="field-sub" style="color:var(--coral-mid);font-weight:500;margin-top:14px">How has your behavior influenced further thoughts about the situation?</p>
        <textarea class="lines" data-field="tfb_r4" style="min-height:56px"></textarea>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="runfoot">
    <span class="motto">Your mind is your most intimate space.</span>
