  <div class="exhead">
    <div style="flex:1;min-width:280px">
      <h1 class="display sm">Observer Mode<br>Journal</h1>
      <p class="body" style="max-width:460px;margin-top:12px">These journaling prompts are about practicing creating some gentle distance between you and your thoughts. Think of yourself as a kind, curious scientist studying your own mind.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="purpose-bar">
      <div><b>Purpose:</b> Practice stepping back from intense emotions and observing your thoughts with gentle curiosity rather than being consumed by them.</div>
      <div><b>Time estimate:</b> 15–20 minutes</div>
    </div>
